      "content": "hey, i had a really weird thing happen about an hour ago. my vision just went all blurry in my left eye for like two mins and my right hand felt super clumsy and shaky, like i couldnt grab stuff right. but it stopped really fast and im totally fine now. should i be worried or is it probably nothing?",
